# ADOS Enterprise Architecture

## Platform Vision

ADOS is a modular AI Enterprise Operating System.

Every component belongs to a business capability.

Never create isolated functionality.

Everything must integrate into the platform.

---

## Main Layers

Platform

↓

Providers

↓

AI Services

↓

Business Modules

↓

Vertical Solutions

↓

Customer Applications

---

## Provider Layer

Providers are integrations.

Examples:

- Cursor
- GitHub
- OpenAI
- Claude
- Obsidian
- Telegram
- WhatsApp

Never place business logic inside providers.

---

## AI Layer

AI Agents

Planner

Executor

Reviewer

Knowledge

Memory

Workflow

Reasoning

All AI modules must remain reusable.

---

## Enterprise Layer

CRM

ERP

Finance

Analytics

Knowledge

Marketplace

Builder

Command Center

These modules communicate only through services.

---

## UI

Reuse Design System.

Never duplicate UI components.

Prefer composition.

---

## API

REST first.

Typed DTOs.

Version APIs.

Never break existing contracts.

---

## Testing

All enterprise functionality must be testable.

Prefer unit tests before integration tests.

---

## Final Principle

Architecture is more important than speed.

Consistency is more important than quantity.